---
// Footer.astro
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white/50 dark:bg-[#141416]/50 py-12 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
          Linear LLM Representations Lab
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          An open, empirical research textbook exploring why nonlinear transformers can appear approximately linear on the hidden states they visit, with strict capacity controls, distribution-shift tests, and causal distinctions.
        </p>
        <div class="text-xs text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500">
          Built as an interactive companion for reproducible representation research.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Exploration
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
          <li><a href="/tutorials" class="hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">14 Executable Tutorials</a></li>
          <li><a href="/notes" class="hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">13 Conceptual Notes</a></li>
          <li><a href="/results" class="hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">Capstone & Artifact Explorer</a></li>
          <li><a href="/explainers" class="hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">Client-Side Explainers</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Repository & CLI
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
          <li><code class="text-[11px] bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">uv sync</code></li>
          <li><code class="text-[11px] bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">uv run pytest</code></li>
          <li><code class="text-[11px] bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">uv run python tutorials/01_linear_maps.py</code></li>
          <li><code class="text-[11px] bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">uv run python experiments/run_capstone.py</code></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-black/[0.04] dark:border-white/[0.04] flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500 gap-4">
      <div>
        Static-first textbook. No model downloads or remote APIs required for browsing.
      </div>
      <div>
        All Python scientific algorithms, tests, and outputs preserved without alteration.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
